# 验证：`grant everything` 少掉的 7 个进度到底是怎么来的。
#
# 假设：进度 X 完成时会给玩家解锁它奖励里的配方；解锁配方会触发
# minecraft:recipe_unlocked，于是拥有那个配方的进度 Y 的 has_the_recipe
# 条件自动完成 —— 如果这时命令还没走到 Y，Y 就被跳过、不计数。
#
# 这一轮先看登录时玩家到底知不知道配方，再看 grant everything 之后
# 那 12 个"奖励指向别的进度"的进度各自处于什么状态。
#
# 期望：
#   - 登录时玩家没有配方（recipe give 说 Successfully given）
#   - 登录时那些进度都没完成
#   - grant everything 报 481
#   - 7 个进度只有 has_the_recipe 完成，5 个进度两个条件都完成

--- console ---
say M01
recipe give Steve minecraft:bone_meal_from_block
say M02
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/bone_meal_from_block
say M03
advancement grant Steve everything
say M04
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/bone_meal_from_block has_the_recipe
say M05
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/bone_meal_from_block has_bone_block
say M06
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/coal has_the_recipe
say M07
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/coal has_coal_block
say M08
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/diamond has_the_recipe
say M09
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/diamond has_diamond_block
say M10
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/emerald has_the_recipe
say M11
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/emerald has_emerald_block
say M12
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/gold_ingot_from_block has_the_recipe
say M13
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/gold_ingot_from_block has_gold_block
say M14
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/wheat has_the_recipe
say M15
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/wheat has_hay_block
say M16
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/iron_ingot_from_block has_the_recipe
say M17
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/iron_ingot_from_block has_iron_block
say M18
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/lapis_lazuli has_the_recipe
say M19
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/lapis_lazuli has_lapis_block
say M20
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/slime_ball has_the_recipe
say M21
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/slime_ball has_slime
say M22
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/gold_nugget has_the_recipe
say M23
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/gold_nugget has_gold_ingot
say M24
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/iron_nugget has_the_recipe
say M25
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/misc/iron_nugget has_iron_ingot
say M26
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/redstone/redstone has_the_recipe
say M27
advancement test Steve minecraft:recipes/redstone/redstone has_redstone_block
say M28
